            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This project can't be opened now: it may still be preparing, be archived, or have changed permissions. Return to the list, refresh, and try again."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このプロジェクトは現在開けません。準備中・アーカイブ済み・権限変更のいずれかの可能性があります。一覧に戻って更新後、再度お試しください。"
          }
